  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.3.0 - High-Performance Update:\n🚀 Performance:\n- SfBitArray3D: Added AVX-optimized PopCount (~360x faster than native loops).\n- SfRingBuffer: Removed modulo operations, now ~3.5x faster than Queue<T>.\n- SfGrid2D/3D: Optimized memory layout for cache locality.\n\n✨ Features:\n- Zero-Allocation Iteration: All collections now use struct enumerators.\n- AsSpan() Support: Added direct memory access for Zero-Copy serialization.\n- SfList: Added RemoveAtSwap (O(1) removal) and EnsureCapacity.\n\n⚠️ Breaking Changes:\n- Removed SfDictionary and SfSortedDictionary temporarily for re-architecture.",
